Done on design/v1 after acafdcf. Decisions: ObjectFormat reads rev-parse --show-object-format, one more git process per sync (in Open) and per ReadState; HashBlob keeps the recipe and swaps the hash. ls-remote --exit-code: exit 2 means reachable without the ref, any other failure is offline. issuesChangedIDs is a second function beside issuesChanged (bytes), used only by ReadState; Run keeps the byte comparison for Fetched/Pushed since it already holds the files. Gotcha: isHash already accepted 64-hex IDs, so nothing else needed for sha256. Not changed: Run still reads every blob of both refs for the merge, which it needs.